  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.73,
      397.19,
      237.47
    ],
    "text": "3.The following new section is hereby addedimmediately after section 9 of principal enactment andshall have effect as section 10 of that enactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      249.53,
      397.2,
      307.67
    ],
    "text": "(1). The Minister may from time to time makeregulations for the purpose of carrying out orgiving effect to the principles and provisionsof this Act and in particular in respect of anymatter required under this Act to be prescribed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      319.73,
      397.19,
      366.23
    ],
    "text": "(2) Without prejudice to the generality ofthe powers conferred by subsection (1), theMinister may make regulations in respect ofany or all of the following matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      227.95,
      378.29,
      397.18,
      401.27
    ],
    "text": "(a)the fees payable in respect of anymatter under this Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      227.95,
      413.33,
      397.16,
      436.43
    ],
    "text": "(b)the forms to be used for any purposeunder this Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      448.49,
      397.19,
      506.63
    ],
    "text": "(2) Every regulation made by the Ministershall be published in the Gazette and shallcome in to operation on the date of suchpublication or on such later date as may bespecified therein.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      518.69,
      397.18,
      611.87
    ],
    "text": "(3) Every regulation made by the Ministershall as soon as convenient after its publicationin the Gazette, be brought before the Parliamentfor approval. Any such regulation which isnot so approved shall be deemed to berescinded as from the date of its disapproval,but without prejudice to anything previouslydone thereunder.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      623.93,
      397.17,
      670.36
    ],
    "text": "(4) Notification of the date on which anyregulation made by the Minister is deemed tobe so rescinded shall be published in theGazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
